WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
07:30 — Quick capture. Kevin dumps a product idea on his phone before standup — Slack is not his notebook, and he is done pretending it is.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
13:00 — iPad sort. iPad sort by project at lunch; tags beat scrolling a year of threads for “that one thought.”

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
21:00 — Laptop decide. Laptop note detail becomes a decision log — ship, park, or ask — instead of eternal emoji reactions.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:40 — Settings. Settings confirm offline-friendly habits; the ideas stay his even when the VPN sulks.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
22:00 — Phone. Phone clears. Ideas live in IdeaCap, not in a channel he will never search.

